#. Card 6 of 130 · narrative · 30.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:6
msgctxt "031"
msgid ""
"As\n"
"deep as\n"
"lay the workers'\n"
"city below the earth,\n"
"so high above it towered\n"
"the complex named the \"Club"
msgstr ""

#. Card 7 of 130 · narrative · 9.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:7
msgctxt "040"
msgid ""
"Fathers for whom every\n"
"revolution of a machine wheel\n"
"meant gold had created for\n"
"their sons the miracle of the\n"
"Eternal Gardens."
msgstr ""

#. Card 8 of 130 · dialogue · 8.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:8
msgctxt "043"
msgid ""
"\"Which of you ladies\n"
"shall today have the honor\n"
"of entertaining Master Freder,\n"
"Joh Fredersen's son?"
msgstr ""

#. Card 9 of 130 · dialogue · 3.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:9
msgctxt "050"
msgid "\"Freder -! Freder -!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 10 of 130 · narrative · 4.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:10
msgctxt "055"
msgid "These are your brothers!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 11 of 130 · dialogue · 5.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:11
msgctxt "056"
msgid "\"Look--!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 12 of 130 · dialogue · 4.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:12
msgctxt "057"
msgid "\"These are your brothers!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 13 of 130 · dialogue · 3.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:13
msgctxt "067"
msgid "\"Who -- was that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 14 of 130 · narrative · 9.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:14
msgctxt "071"
msgid ""
"But this is what happened to\n"
"Freder - son o of Joh Fredersen,\n"
"master of Metropolis -- when he\n"
"went in search of the girl:"
msgstr ""

#. Card 15 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:15
msgctxt "093"
msgid ""
"\"o the new Tower of Babel -\n"
"to my father -!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 16 of 130 · dialogue · 25.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:16
msgctxt "131"
msgid ""
"\"Why is it, Josaphat,\n"
"that I learn of the explosion\n"
"from my son,\n"
"and not from you -- --!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 17 of 130 · dialogue · 10.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:17
msgctxt "138"
msgid ""
"\"What were you doing\n"
"in the machine halls,\n"
"Freder?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 18 of 130 · dialogue · 10.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:18
msgctxt "139"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to look into\n"
"the faces of the people\n"
"whose little children are\n"
"my brothers, my sisters..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 19 of 130 · dialogue · 7.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:19
msgctxt "142"
msgid ""
"\"Yur magnificent city, Father --\n"
"and you the brain of this city -\n"
"and all of us\n"
"in the city's light... -- ."
msgstr ""

#. Card 20 of 130 · dialogue · 9.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:20
msgctxt "149"
msgid ""
"\"What if one day\n"
"those in the depths\n"
"rise up against you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 21 of 130 · dialogue · 11.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:21
msgctxt "157"
msgid ""
"\"The chief foreman\n"
"of the Heart Machine, Grot -\n"
"with an important message."
msgstr ""

#. Card 22 of 130 · narrative · 19.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:22
msgctxt "166"
msgid ""
"..in the pockets of two men\n"
"involved in today's accident\n"
"at the M-Machine."
msgstr ""

#. Card 23 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:23
msgctxt "171"
msgid ""
"\"Apply to the G-Bank\n"
"for your remaining wages."
msgstr ""

#. Card 24 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:24
msgctxt "189"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know\n"
"what it means\n"
"to be dismissed like that\n"
"by Joh Fredersen?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 25 of 130 · dialogue · 5.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:25
msgctxt "193"
msgid ""
"\"Do you want to work for me,\n"
"Josaphat?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 26 of 130 · dialogue · 12.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:26
msgctxt "198"
msgid ""
"\"Where do you live, Josaphat?\"\n"
"Freder asked, and noted:\n"
"Block99,House7,7thFloor."
msgstr ""

#. Card 27 of 130 · dialogue · 3.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:27
msgctxt "212"
msgid "\"Brother...\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 28 of 130 · dialogue · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:28
msgctxt "213"
msgid ""
"\"...the machine!...\n"
"Someone has to stay\n"
"at the machine!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 29 of 130 · dialogue · 7.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:29
msgctxt "214"
msgid ""
"\"Someone will stay\n"
"at the machine...\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 30 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:30
msgctxt "215"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me...\n"
"I want to trade lives\n"
"with you!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 31 of 130 · narrative · 10.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:31
msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile,theThin Man,\n"
"JohFredersen'sspy,iswatching\n"
"the spot where Freder's chauffeur\n"
"hasparkedhiscar."
msgstr ""

#. Card 32 of 130 · dialogue · 4.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:32
msgctxt "217"
msgid ""
"\"Wait for me --\n"
"both of you..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 33 of 130 · narrative · 64.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:33
msgctxt "221"
msgid ""
"In the middle of Metropolis\n"
"there was a strange house,\n"
"overlooked by the centuries."
msgstr ""

#. Card 34 of 130 · narrative · 49.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:34
msgctxt "222"
msgid ""
"There,ona pedestal as wide\n"
"asawall and astallas aman,\n"
"he sees the stone head of a woman."
msgstr ""

#. Card 35 of 130 · narrative · 31.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:35
msgctxt "223"
msgid ""
"The angier Rawang becomes,\n"
"the calmer grows Joh Fredersen,"
msgstr ""

#. Card 36 of 130 · narrative · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:36
msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Let the dead rest in peace,\n"
"Rotwang...\n"
"For you, as for me, she is dead."
msgstr ""

#. Card 37 of 130 · dialogue · 7.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:37
msgctxt "225"
msgid ""
"\"For me, she is not dead,\n"
"Joh Fredersen, --\n"
"forme, she lives --!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 38 of 130 · dialogue · 11.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:38
msgctxt "226"
msgid ""
"\"Do you think\n"
"that losing a hand\n"
"is too high a price to pay\n"
"for re-creating Hel -?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 39 of 130 · dialogue · 9.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:39
msgctxt "234"
msgid ""
"\"So, Joh Fredersen—?!\n"
"Isn't it worth\n"
"the loss of a hand to have\n"
"created the man of the future,\n"
"the\n"
"Machine-Man—?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 40 of 130 · dialogue · 12.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:40
msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"“Give me another 24 hours --\n"
"and no one, Joh Fredersen,\n"
"no one will be able\n"
"to tell a Machine-Man\n"
"from a mortal - -!'"
msgstr ""

#. Card 41 of 130 · dialogue · 8.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:41
msgctxt "239"
msgid ""
"\"The woman is m i n e ,\n"
"Joh Fredersen!\n"
"The son of Hel  was yours!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 42 of 130 · dialogue · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:42
msgctxt "241"
msgid ""
"\"And what brings you to me,\n"
"Joh Fredersen?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 43 of 130 · dialogue · 16.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:43
msgctxt "242"
msgid ""
"\"As usual.\n"
"when my experts fail me,\n"
"I come to you for advice..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 44 of 130 · dialogue · 8.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:44
msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"\"For months now,\n"
"we have been finding\n"
"these plans\n"
"in my workers' clothes.\n"
"What do they mean?"
msgstr ""

#. Card 45 of 130 · narrative · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:45
msgctxt "251"
msgid ""
"...at two...\n"
"at the end of the shift!\n"
"Sh e has summoned us again.."
msgstr ""

#. Card 46 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:46
msgctxt "257"
msgid ""
"\"Father—! Father—!\n"
"Will ten hours\n"
"never end——??!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 47 of 130 · dialogue · 26.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:47
msgctxt "259"
msgid ""
"\"-it is a plan of the\n"
"2000-year-old catacombs\n"
"deep below the lowest levels\n"
"of your Metropolis..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 48 of 130 · dialogue · 13.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:48
msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"\"I should like\n"
"to know what\n"
"my workers are doing\n"
"in the catacombs..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 49 of 130 · dialogue · 18.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:49
msgctxt "273"
msgid ""
"\"Today I will tell you\n"
"the legend of\n"
"THE TOWER\n"
"OF BABEL...\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 50 of 130 · dialogue · 12.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:50
msgctxt "274"
msgid ""
"\"Come, let us\n"
"build us a tower\n"
"whose top may reach\n"
"unto the stars!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 51 of 130 · narrative · 10.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:51
msgctxt "278"
msgid ""
"...but the minds that had\n"
"conceived the Tower of Babel\n"
"could not build it.\n"
"The task was too great.\n"
"So they hired hands\n"
"for wages."
msgstr ""

#. Card 52 of 130 · narrative · 10.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:52
msgctxt "279"
msgid ""
"But the h a n d s that\n"
"built the Tower of Babel\n"
"knew nothing of the dream\n"
"of the b r a i n that had\n"
"conceived it."
msgstr ""

#. Card 53 of 130 · title · 3.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:53
msgctxt "280"
msgid "Babel"
msgstr ""

#. Card 54 of 130 · title · 10.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:54
msgctxt "282"
msgid "Babel"
msgstr ""

#. Card 55 of 130 · narrative · 6.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:55
msgctxt "283"
msgid ""
"People spoke the same language,\n"
"but could not understand\n"
"each other..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 56 of 130 · narrative · 7.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:56
msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Great is the world and its creator\n"
"and great is man"
msgstr ""

#. Card 57 of 130 · dialogue · 13.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:57
msgctxt "289"
msgid ""
"\"The mediator\n"
"between head and hands\n"
"must be the heart!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 58 of 130 · dialogue · 8.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:58
msgctxt "306"
msgid ""
"\"Oh mediator,\n"
"have you finally come?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 59 of 130 · dialogue · 6.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:59
msgctxt "307"
msgid ""
"“Yu called me -- --\n"
"here I am!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 60 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:60
msgctxt "315"
msgid ""
"\"Until tomorrow,\n"
"in the cathedral!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 61 of 130 · narrative · 105.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:61
msgctxt "342"
msgid ""
"Feder seesamonkinthepulpit\n"
"who preaches:\"Verily,I say unto you,\n"
"the days spoken of in the Apocalypse\n"
"arenigh!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 62 of 130 · narrative · 65.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:62
msgctxt "346"
msgid ""
"Disappointed that Maria has\n"
"not come,Freder goesto\n"
"Josaphat's home, where he\n"
"hopestofindWorker11811."
msgstr ""

#. Card 63 of 130 · dialogue · 15.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:63
msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"\"Come! It is time\n"
"to give the Machine-Man\n"
"your face!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 64 of 130 · dialogue · 26.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:64
msgctxt "414"
msgid ""
"\"She is\n"
"with your father..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 65 of 130 · dialogue · 12.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:65
msgctxt "418"
msgid ""
"“I want you\n"
"to visit those in the depths,\n"
"in order to destroy\n"
"the work of the woman\n"
"in whose image you were created!”"
msgstr ""

#. Card 66 of 130 · dialogue · 2.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:66
msgctxt "424"
msgid "“Maria—!”"
msgstr ""

#. Card 67 of 130 · insert · 2.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:67
msgctxt "435"
msgid ""
"Mr. C. A. Rotwang\n"
"Requests the pleasure\n"
"of\n"
"Your company at dinner\n"
"and to see a new Erotic\n"
"Dancer."
msgstr ""

#. Card 68 of 130 · narrative · 15.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:68
msgctxt "447"
msgid ""
"TheThinMan in theform\n"
"ofamonkpreaches:\n"
"\"Verily,I sayuntoyou,\n"
"thedays spoken of in the Apocalypse\n"
"are nigh...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 69 of 130 · dialogue · 10.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:69
msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"\"And thewoman was arrayed\n"
"in purple and scarlet color,\n"
"having a golden cup in her hand..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 70 of 130 · dialogue · 6.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:70
msgctxt "457"
msgid ""
"“For her –\n"
"all seven deadly sins!”"
msgstr ""

#. Card 71 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:71
msgctxt "466"
msgid ""
"“Death descends\n"
"upon the city – – –!”"
msgstr ""

#. Card 72 of 130 · dialogue · 9.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:72
msgctxt "471"
msgid ""
"\"I put on this disguise\n"
"to escape from the Thin Man.\n"
"But for ten days your father's spy\n"
"has been making\n"
"even the workers' city risky.."
msgstr ""

#. Card 73 of 130 · narrative · 16.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:73
msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"JosaphatrelatestoFreder\n"
"more of the strangeevents\n"
"afterhiscollapse:\n"
"\"On the evening you fell sick..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 74 of 130 · narrative · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:74
msgctxt "475"
msgid ""
"..once the best of friends\n"
"because of that woman."
msgstr ""

#. Card 75 of 130 · narrative · 5.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:75
msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"...the other man.\n"
"the same evening.."
msgstr ""

#. Card 76 of 130 · dialogue · 6.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:76
msgctxt "478"
msgid ""
"\"The Eternal Gardens\n"
"lie abandoned..\n"
"but night after night in Xshiwara."
msgstr ""

#. Card 77 of 130 · narrative · 13.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:77
msgctxt "481"
msgid "..s also named Maria."
msgstr ""

#. Card 78 of 130 · narrative · 25.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:78
msgctxt "483"
msgid ""
"Frederreminds Josaphat:\n"
"\"Many now go to the city of the dead,\n"
"toawomanwhohasproven\n"
"herself as true as gold..."
msgstr ""

#. Card 79 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:79
msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"\"She will destroy\n"
"their belief in a mediator!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 80 of 130 · narrative · 7.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:80
msgctxt "491"
msgid ""
"ou know that I have\n"
"always spoken of peace..\n"
"but your mediator has not come."
msgstr ""

#. Card 81 of 130 · dialogue · 6.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:81
msgctxt "494"
msgid ""
"“You have waited long enough!\n"
"Your time has come –!”"
msgstr ""

#. Card 82 of 130 · narrative · 13.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:82
msgctxt "495"
msgid ""
"..but I have tricked Joh Fredersen!\n"
"Xur double does not\n"
"obey h i s will --\n"
"only min e!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 83 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:83
msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"\"Who is the living food\n"
"for the machines in Metropolis -?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 84 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:84
msgctxt "497"
msgid ""
"\"Who lubricates\n"
"the machine joints\n"
"with their own  n blood-?!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 85 of 130 · narrative · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:85
msgctxt "498"
msgid ""
"Who feeds the machines\n"
"with their own flesh - --?!'"
msgstr ""

#. Card 86 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:86
msgctxt "499"
msgid ""
"\"Let the machines starve,\n"
"you fools–!\n"
"Let them die–!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 87 of 130 · narrative · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:87
msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Kill them -\n"
"the machines-!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 88 of 130 · dialogue · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:88
msgctxt "501"
msgid "\"Yu are not Maria -!!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 89 of 130 · dialogue · 4.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:89
msgctxt "502"
msgid "\"You are not Maria–!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 90 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:90
msgctxt "503"
msgid ""
"“Maria speaks of peace,\n"
"not killing -!\n"
"This is not Maria -!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 91 of 130 · narrative · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:91
msgctxt "504"
msgid "Joh Fredersen's son -!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 92 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:92
msgctxt "505"
msgid ""
"\"Kill him, the dog,\n"
"in his white siken fur-!!!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 93 of 130 · narrative · 8.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:93
msgctxt "509"
msgid ""
"Get your women, your sons,\n"
"from the workers' city!\n"
"Let no one stay behind!\n"
"Death to the machines -!!!"
msgstr ""

#. Card 94 of 130 · narrative · 23.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:94
msgctxt "510"
msgid ""
"...andItrickedJohFredersen\n"
"twiceover-!ForIconcealed\n"
"fromhimthathis sonwants\n"
"tobeyourbrothers'mediator\n"
"-andlovesyou-!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 95 of 130 · dialogue · 4.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:95
msgctxt "513"
msgid "\"...faithful after all...\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 96 of 130 · narrative · 17.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:96
msgctxt "514"
msgid ""
"JohFredersenbreaksinto\n"
"Rotwang's attic.Hebattles\n"
"withhisoldrival,\n"
"overcominghim.Maria is free"
msgstr ""

#. Card 97 of 130 · dialogue · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:97
msgctxt "515"
msgid ""
"\"Women and men,\n"
"let no one miss today-!\n"
"Death to the machines --!!'"
msgstr ""

#. Card 98 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:98
msgctxt "521"
msgid ""
"\"Not one man –\n"
"or woman\n"
"remained behind–!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 99 of 130 · narrative · 14.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:99
msgctxt "525"
msgid ""
"ThemobstormstheM-Machine\n"
"and rushes toward the Heart Machine,\n"
"thepowerhouseofMetropolis."
msgstr ""

#. Card 100 of 130 · dialogue · 4.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:100
msgctxt "535"
msgid "\"Open the gates!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 101 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:101
msgctxt "536"
msgid "\"Open the gates, I said!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 102 of 130 · narrative · 6.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:102
msgctxt "537"
msgid ""
"GrotwarnsFredersen:\n"
"\"If the HeartMachineis\n"
"destroyed, the entire machine\n"
"district will end up in ruins."
msgstr ""

#. Card 103 of 130 · narrative · 8.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:103
msgctxt "538"
msgid ""
"FinallyGrotobeysJohFredersen's\n"
"orderandopensthegates.\n"
"The workers race to the Heart Machine."
msgstr ""

#. Card 104 of 130 · dialogue · 9.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:104
msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"\"Have you gone mad -??\n"
"If the Heart Machine is destroyed,\n"
"the entire workers' city\n"
"will be flooded -!!'"
msgstr ""

#. Card 105 of 130 · dialogue · 5.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:105
msgctxt "565"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know\n"
"that your son\n"
"is among the workers?\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 106 of 130 · dialogue · 5.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:106
msgctxt "571"
msgid ""
"\"Yes -- you!\n"
"Yu are Maria -!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 107 of 130 · dialogue · 6.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:107
msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"\"To the air shafts --\n"
"quickly! Quickly!\n"
"The reservoirs have burst!\n"
"The city is flooding-!\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 108 of 130 · narrative · 4.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:108
