#. Card 114 of 130 · dialogue · 8.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:114
msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"\"Who told you\n"
"to attack the machines,\n"
"you idiots?\n"
"Without them you'll all die!!'"
