#. Card 119 of 130 · narrative · 6.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/metropolis-1927/cards.yaml:119
msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Marialeadsthelast ofthe\n"
"childrento safetyinthe\n"
"CluboftheSons."
